content:
Design RF Tranceiver 100MHz, create LNA, PA, Mixer, LO, create top level for receiver and transmitter too, and then combine both in 1 top level again

Use GF180MCU 3.3V devices (nfet_03v3 / pfet_03v3) with VDD = 3.3V.

OpenADA scoped preflight (assertion spice-analysis-evidence-valid): {"engineering": "pass", "summary": "Preflight selected 'simulate' and found ngspice usable; no design assertion was executed."}

